\b\lang16393 2. Fine-Tuning\par
\b0 Once pretraining is complete, the model possesses broad language knowledge but may not excel at a particular task. \b Fine-tuning\b0  is the process of further training the pretrained model on a smaller, task-specific dataset.\par
Instead of learning language from scratch, the model adapts its existing knowledge to solve a particular problem.\par
