\b Positional Encoding After Embedding\par
\b0 One limitation of embeddings is that they contain \b meaning but not order\b0 .\par
For example:\par
Plain Text\par
Dog bites man\par
and\par
Plain Text\par
Man bites dog\par
would initially contain the same token embeddings arranged differently.\par
To help the Transformer understand sequence order, \b Positional Encodings\b0  are added to embeddings.\par
Plain Text\par
Final Input =\par
Token Embedding +\par
Positional Encoding\par
Plain Text\par
Token Embedding\par
+\par
Positional Encoding\par
\f5\u8595?\f0\lang16393\par
Position-Aware Embedding\par
